	(text "R1/R2 0R in series: room for a small damping R per leg.  C1/C2 100p C0G fitted (with the IFL05K).\nC3/C4 DNP in parallel: +82p for the no-ferrite runs, or to trim.  R3 DNP across the coil (0603): parallel damping."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
